  "prefLabel": "He-P 4021.18 Notifications and Reports to Individuals",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "He-P 4021.18 Notifications and Reports to Individuals.\n\n(a) Requirements for notification and reports to individuals of exposure to radiation or radioactive material shall be as specified in He-P 4019.05.\n\n(b) When a licensee or registrant is required pursuant to He-P 4021.14 to report to DHHS/RHS any exposure of an individual to radiation or radioactive material, the licensee or registrant shall also notify the individual.\n\n(c) Such notice as stated in (b) above shall be transmitted at a time not later than the transmittal to DHHS/RHS and shall comply with the provisions of He-P 4019.05.\n\nSource. #5903, eff 2-1-95; ss by #6827, eff 8-6-98; ss by #8481, eff 11-5-05; ss by #10604, eff 5-23-14; ss by #14091, eff 10-1-24",
